From: DerpFest <derpfest@local>
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Launcher3: fix nav-bar search haptic loop on QTI vibrator

Replace LOW_TICK ramp composition with one-shot pulse for LPNH hint/commit.
Set LPNH_HAPTIC_HINT_ITERATIONS default from 50 to 1.

Note: ContextualSearchHapticManager diff is against AOSP main; if your tree
uses Dagger injection, port the FuxiHapticEffects calls manually.
---
--- a/packages/apps/Launcher3/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/util/FuxiHapticEffects.kt	2026-07-07 11:40:40.107562662 +0300
+++ b/packages/apps/Launcher3/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/util/FuxiHapticEffects.kt
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+/*
